1
00:00:00,214 --> 00:00:02,924
(Howard:)Damn his Vulcan hearing.

2
00:00:03,092 --> 00:00:05,722
(Leonard:)Not a good time, Sheldon.

3
00:00:06,137 --> 00:00:07,177
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

4
00:00:07,347 --> 00:00:09,307
SHELDON:
Penny. Penny. Penny.

5
00:00:09,474 --> 00:00:10,724
Ugh, this is ridiculous.

6
00:00:10,892 --> 00:00:12,352
[LEONARD GROANS]

7
00:00:12,518 --> 00:00:14,148
(Sheldon:)-What?
-Hello, Penny.

8
00:00:14,312 --> 00:00:17,772
(Sheldon:)I realize you're currently at the mercy
of your biological urges...

9
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:22,400
...but as you have a lifetime of poor
decisions ahead, may I interrupt this one?

10
00:00:23,738 --> 00:00:25,368
(Penny:)Great to see you too. Come on in.

11
00:00:26,407 --> 00:00:29,497
(Sheldon:)Wolowitz has informed me
of your grand deception.

12
00:00:29,660 --> 00:00:31,410
Do you have anything to say?

13
00:00:31,579 --> 00:00:35,079
(Leonard:)Yes, I feel terrible about it.
I will never forgive myself.

14
00:00:35,249 --> 00:00:38,839
I don't expect you to. I'd appreciate it
if you'd leave me with Penny...

15
00:00:39,003 --> 00:00:42,293
(Leonard:)...for a session of self-criticism
and repentance.

16
00:00:45,718 --> 00:00:47,848
Can someone tell me
what's going on here?

17
00:00:48,012 --> 00:00:52,562
(Sheldon:)What's going on is I was led to believe
I was making strides in science...

18
00:00:52,725 --> 00:00:54,895
(Sheldon:)...when in fact
I was being fed false data...

19
00:00:55,061 --> 00:01:00,021
(Sheldon:)...at the hands of Wolowitz, Koothrappali
and your furry little boy toy.

